  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><div class=\"qMYqUG_convSearchResultHighlightRoot\"><div><section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto R6Vx5W_threadScrollVars scroll-mb-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)+var(--thread-response-height))] scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\"><div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\"><div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\"><div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\"><div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\"><div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\"><div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full light markdown-new-styling\"><h2>Join the Midway Wool Flock!</h2><p>Love the feeling of creating by hand? We’re looking for passionate makers, bloggers, and creators to share the joy of wool appliqué, punch needle, and embroidery with the world. By joining our affiliate program, you can earn commissions while helping others discover the rewarding world of textile arts.</p><h3>Quick Glance</h3><ul><li><p><strong>What We Sell:</strong> Premium wool appliqué, punch needle, embroidery, and needle felting kits, patterns, monthly subscriptions, and step-by-step tutorials.</p></li><li><p><strong>Our Secret Sauce:</strong> Original, heartwarming designs, top-tier materials, and an absolute obsession with high-quality education.</p></li><li><p><strong>Affiliate Earnings:</strong> Competitive commissions on all qualifying sales generated through your unique links.</p></li><li><p><strong>Best Ways to Share:</strong> Social media walkthroughs, blog reviews, email newsletters, \"stitch-along\" videos, and unboxings.</p></li><li><p><strong>Who We Are:</strong> Family-owned, education-focused, and deeply community-driven.</p></li></ul><h3>Why Partner with Midway Wool?</h3><p>At Midway Wool, we believe that crafting should be meaningful, enjoyable, and achievable for everyone. We don’t just sell kits; we provide the confidence and step-by-step education makers need to succeed. As a family-owned business, we treat our community like a flock, and we view our affiliates as an extension of that family.</p><p>When you promote Midway Wool, you’re sharing original designs and quality materials that you can truly stand behind.</p><h3>How You Can Earn</h3><p>Every time you introduce a fellow crafter to our products, subscriptions, or educational resources using your unique referral link, you’ll earn a commission on their purchase. It’s that simple.</p><h3>Fun Ways to Promote Us</h3><p>We love seeing how creative our affiliates can be! The best results come from authentic sharing, such as:</p><ul><li><p><strong>Show &amp; Tell:</strong> Share videos or photos of your finished Midway Wool projects.</p></li><li><p><strong>Unboxings:</strong> Give your audience a sneak peek at the gorgeous textures and materials inside our kits or monthly subscription boxes.</p></li><li><p><strong>Tutorials &amp; Tips:</strong> Host a mini-tutorial or share your favorite crafting tips using our patterns.</p></li><li><p><strong>Seasonal Inspiration:</strong> Highlight our seasonal kits just in time for holiday crafting.</p></li></ul><p>We invite makers of all skill levels to join our flock, inspire others, and enjoy the beautiful community we’re building together. Ready to create with us? <strong>Apply today!</strong></p></div></div></div></div></div></div></section></div></div><div class=\"pointer-events-none -mt-px h-px translate-y-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom)-14*var(--spacing))]\"><br></div></div></div>",
